Hi,

I'm announcing the release of lm_sensors 3.6.0. Get it from GitHub [1].

The release features improved device detection, a number of new
configuration files, fixes for raw and JSON output formats in sensors
and more. See the CHANGES file [2] for a detailed list of user-visible
changes.

Thanks to everyone who contributed to this release!

[1] https://github.com/lm-sensors/lm-sensors/releases
[2] https://github.com/lm-sensors/lm-sensors/blob/V3-6-0/CHANGES

